# AICL Example: Bubble Sort
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Sort an array using bubble sort

Risk:
Empty array
Recovery:
Return empty array

Layer:
Core

Behavior Sort
    Input: array
    Output: array
    Action:
        n = len(array)
        for i in range(0, n):
            for j in range(0, n - i - 1):
                if array[j] > array[j + 1]:
                    array[j], array[j + 1] = array[j + 1], array[j]
        return array
